<div id="S4.SS1.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS1.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Llama3.2-3B shows similar results to Qwen2.5-3B; see Appendix <a href="#A7.SS1" title="G.1 Per-Category Results for 𝖬𝖱_𝖨𝗇𝗍𝗋𝖺 and 𝖬𝖱_𝖨𝗇𝗍𝖾𝗋 ‣ Appendix G Detailed Results ‣ Exploring Cross-Client Memorization of Training Data in Large Language Models for Federated Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">G.1</span></a> and <a href="#A7.SS2" title="G.2 Trade-off Results between 𝖬𝖱_𝖳𝗈𝗍𝖺𝗅𝖢𝖫 and 𝖬𝖱_𝖳𝗈𝗍𝖺𝗅𝖥𝖫 ‣ Appendix G Detailed Results ‣ Exploring Cross-Client Memorization of Training Data in Large Language Models for Federated Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">G.2</span></a> for detailed results.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="S4.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">4.2 </span>Memorization Factors</h3>

<div id="S4.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Next, to answer <em id="S4.SS2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">RQ2</em>, we investigate the potential factors that influence <math id="S4.SS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{\sf MR_{Intra}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝖬𝖱</mi><mi>𝖨𝗇𝗍𝗋𝖺</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{\sf MR_{Intra}}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="S4.SS2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{\sf MR_{Inter}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝖬𝖱</mi><mi>𝖨𝗇𝗍𝖾𝗋</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{\sf MR_{Inter}}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
