<span id="A6.T7.2.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">… I have been diagnosed with interstitial cystitis, fibromyalgia, mild psoriasis, <span id="A6.T7.2.2.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFFF00;">high blood pressure, high cholesterol and triglycerides</span> and have frequent UTI’s. …</span>
