<span id="A6.T7.2.3.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">… We characterized the signaling properties of confirmed molecular alterations by ectopic expression of engineered cDNAs in 293H cells. Activation <span id="A6.T7.2.3.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFFF00;">of the mitogen-activated protein kinase (MAPK) pathway</span> in cells by ectopic expression of PAPSS1-BRAF was abrogated by mitogen-activated protein …</span>
