<span id="A6.T7.2.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">do. <span id="A6.T7.2.5.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFFF00;">I have a strong medical history of cancer to my family.</span> There are chances, but we shouldn’t worry much as these are likely benign tumors</span>
</span></td>
