<div id="A7.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A7.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We provide the breakdown results from Table <a href="#S4.T2" title="Table 2 ‣ 4.1 Memorization in Federated Learning ‣ 4 Results ‣ Exploring Cross-Client Memorization of Training Data in Large Language Models for Federated Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> in Table <a href="#A7.T9" title="Table 9 ‣ G.2 Trade-off Results between 𝖬𝖱_𝖳𝗈𝗍𝖺𝗅𝖢𝖫 and 𝖬𝖱_𝖳𝗈𝗍𝖺𝗅𝖥𝖫 ‣ Appendix G Detailed Results ‣ Exploring Cross-Client Memorization of Training Data in Large Language Models for Federated Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>.</p>
</div>
</section>
