<div id="A7.SS7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A7.SS7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A7.T14" title="Table 14 ‣ G.7 Memorization with various Communication Rounds ‣ Appendix G Detailed Results ‣ Exploring Cross-Client Memorization of Training Data in Large Language Models for Federated Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">14</span></a> indicates that communication rounds does not noticeably affect memorization for either Qwen2.5-3B or Llama3.2-3B across tasks.</p>
</div>
</section>
