<div id="A7.SS8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A7.SS8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We observe no clear trend in memorization when shifting from CL to FL for Qwen2.5-3B or Llama3.2-3B as shown in Table <a href="#A7.T15" title="Table 15 ‣ G.8 Trade-off between Performance and Memorization CL and FedAvg ‣ Appendix G Detailed Results ‣ Exploring Cross-Client Memorization of Training Data in Large Language Models for Federated Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">15</span></a>. Furthermore, we found no correlation between memorization and performance in either setting.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
